# ---- pipeline-health close-out age-out (optional — hub only) ----
# bin/pipeline-health.sh checks 4 and 5 stop paging for a build RESULT older
# than this many hours, record it once in state/closeout-aged-out.tsv, and say
# so in one summary line per project in logs/pipeline-health.log. Records under
# the ceiling are still checked against the merge ledger, and an outage is never
# read as terminal (bin/lib/closeout-terminal.sh). Default 168h; a non-numeric
# value falls back to 168 rather than disabling the check.
#CLOSEOUT_AGE_OUT_H=168

